    <h1 class="article-title">Does Slack Remove PDF Metadata? What Happens When You Share PDFs in Teams & Email</h1>
    <p class="article-subtitle">Every internal share creates a copy you don't control. Here's what's actually riding along inside it, and where each platform sends it next.</p>
